WEBVTT

01:36.170 --> 01:40.970
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.509 --> 01:43.890
[Episode 15]

01:56.870 --> 01:57.590
Son.

01:58.710 --> 02:02.040
Forgive me for only being able

02:02.280 --> 02:04.080
to tell you the truth in this way.

02:06.230 --> 02:07.830
Your father and I lied to you.

02:09.360 --> 02:12.910
Actually, Sword Manor doesn't have
much water left.

02:15.380 --> 02:17.540
After discussing with your uncles,

02:18.280 --> 02:19.150
we decided

02:19.840 --> 02:22.370
to leave the opportunity
to you young people.

02:35.190 --> 02:35.870
My son...

02:38.280 --> 02:40.610
I'm afraid
I won't live to see your return.

02:41.750 --> 02:43.550
I only hope you can successfully

02:43.800 --> 02:45.530
find your brothers and sister,

02:46.470 --> 02:49.840
and the four of you
can live well from now on.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.079
In time,

02:52.360 --> 02:55.910
you'll surely become
the pillar of the Xiao family.

02:58.750 --> 03:00.520
Your father and I, in spirit,

03:01.960 --> 03:03.840
will be proud of you.

03:10.800 --> 03:11.600
Oh, by the way,

03:12.500 --> 03:14.500
let me tell you something in secret.

03:14.910 --> 03:17.110
Don't tell Yiren and Kaiyan about this.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.280
Actually,

03:23.400 --> 03:26.960
you're the most handsome son in my heart.

03:30.750 --> 03:33.840
Mother, Sun Huishan.

03:35.480 --> 03:36.210
Final words.

03:46.329 --> 03:48.460
[Sword Manor won't last much longer.]

03:58.190 --> 04:00.310
[The water supply there is insufficient.]

04:00.310 --> 04:02.430
[The Power Gang outside Sword Manor
is watching like hawks,]

04:02.430 --> 04:04.560
[surrounding them without retreat.]

04:08.730 --> 04:10.260
When I see Yiren and Kaiyan,

04:11.800 --> 04:12.860
I need to tell them.

04:14.120 --> 04:14.920
It's too late.

04:16.649 --> 04:17.579
What should I do?

04:20.600 --> 04:21.510
Yiren!

04:23.270 --> 04:24.390
Yiren!

04:35.190 --> 04:37.159
Yiren, Kaiyan, Xueyu.

04:38.510 --> 04:40.310
Hurry back and save our parents.

04:41.190 --> 04:43.190
Sword Manor is running out of water.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.560
Father and Mother...

04:46.560 --> 04:48.159
They can't wait any longer.

04:51.190 --> 04:53.250
Why would Mother write such a letter?

04:54.240 --> 04:55.570
Could it be that they...

05:00.270 --> 05:01.730
We'll set out immediately

05:01.750 --> 05:03.150
and travel day and night.

05:03.190 --> 05:04.880
We'll definitely make it back
to Sword Manor in time.

05:04.880 --> 05:05.740
Xueyu is right.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.190
Mr. Qu

05:07.270 --> 05:09.710
has gathered the righteous warriors
of Guangling.

05:09.710 --> 05:10.710
Once we join forces,

05:10.710 --> 05:12.240
we'll set off immediately.

05:13.080 --> 05:13.920
Yiren.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.830
That'll be too late.

05:18.270 --> 05:20.310
We really can't delay any longer.

05:21.190 --> 05:25.720
Qu Hanshan will never help us.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.920
If you don't go now,

05:28.360 --> 05:29.560
Father and Mother...

05:30.680 --> 05:33.560
They'll really die.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.159
Shut up!

05:37.360 --> 05:39.110
How could you speak
such discouraging words?

05:39.110 --> 05:41.800
The martial world of Guangling
has promised to come to Sword Manor's aid.

05:41.800 --> 05:44.060
Why do you still refuse to believe Mr. Qu?

05:45.390 --> 05:47.720
I'm really not making this up.

05:49.600 --> 05:50.800
I truly know

05:50.800 --> 05:53.270
the plot and events of the future!

05:54.000 --> 05:54.600
[Warning]

05:59.800 --> 06:02.400
Qiushui, what nonsense
are you talking about?

06:02.950 --> 06:06.240
[You've violated the character settings
by revealing plot details.]

06:06.240 --> 06:08.750
[The Boiling Blood Cocoon punishment
will begin shortly.]

06:08.750 --> 06:10.410
[Health points decreasing.]

06:27.270 --> 06:29.950
Suppose... Just suppose

06:31.120 --> 06:33.600
I somehow ended up in this storybook.

06:34.830 --> 06:37.230
I could know the ending of
the entire story,

06:37.950 --> 06:39.630
and I could know everything.

06:40.510 --> 06:41.640
Saying it like this,

06:42.750 --> 06:44.010
do you understand now?

06:45.270 --> 06:47.830
Qiushui, what on earth
are you talking about?

06:51.360 --> 06:53.190
I'm really not making this up.

06:53.920 --> 06:56.560
I just want to save Father and Mother.

06:59.240 --> 06:59.750
Enough!

06:59.950 --> 07:01.810
I taught you everything you know.

07:02.160 --> 07:04.270
I've always hoped
you'd grow up quickly,

07:04.270 --> 07:06.190
so one day you could support me

07:06.190 --> 07:07.320
and the Xiao family.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.490
But what about you?

07:08.750 --> 07:11.080
Look at what you've been doing and saying!

07:12.240 --> 07:12.750
Yiren.

07:13.160 --> 07:13.750
Yiren!

07:14.000 --> 07:14.930
-Yiren!
-Yiren!

07:15.070 --> 07:15.630
Yiren!

07:16.750 --> 07:17.870
-Qiushui!
-Yiren!

07:17.870 --> 07:19.070
-Qiushui!
-Qiushui.

07:19.160 --> 07:19.650
Come on.

07:28.990 --> 07:33.190
Yiren, don't bring Qu Hanshan back
to Sword Manor under any circumstances.

07:36.270 --> 07:37.560
I swear on my life—

07:38.480 --> 07:40.540
he's the Sword King of the Power Gang.

07:42.510 --> 07:43.770
When you meet with him,

07:44.870 --> 07:46.670
take him to Top Fairness Forest.

07:47.190 --> 07:48.190
By then,

07:49.600 --> 07:51.400
I'll definitely prove it to you.

07:52.159 --> 07:54.830
Yiren, please.

07:57.159 --> 07:58.270
I'm begging you.

08:00.310 --> 08:00.830
Yiren.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.040
Qiushui wouldn't joke about

08:03.040 --> 08:04.170
our parents' lives.

08:04.270 --> 08:06.070
If Qu Hanshan is truly reliable,

08:06.070 --> 08:07.930
why fear putting him to this test?

08:11.510 --> 08:12.120
Yiren.

08:16.000 --> 08:20.440
Yiren, Qiushui has never begged anyone
like this before.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.290
We've worked so hard

08:25.160 --> 08:27.000
to gain Guangling's support.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.360
Yiren.

08:30.510 --> 08:31.190
This time,

08:32.909 --> 08:34.000
if I cannot prove

08:34.000 --> 08:35.860
that Qu Hanshan is the Sword King,

08:37.510 --> 08:38.840
I'll atone with my life.

08:39.390 --> 08:41.390
Stop risking your life like it's a bet!

08:41.390 --> 08:44.120
Have you forgotten that Mother asked you
to live well in her letter?

08:44.120 --> 08:46.720
Qiushui, I trusted you once before.

08:48.120 --> 08:49.120
But the result...

08:53.600 --> 08:55.730
The Xiao family is now in grave danger.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.850
We cannot afford any mistakes.

08:58.360 --> 09:00.420
Focus on resting and recovering now.

09:14.340 --> 09:16.850
[Xiao Residence]

09:21.670 --> 09:22.270
Miss Tang.

09:23.150 --> 09:24.150
Where is Qiushui?

09:25.720 --> 09:28.650
Big Brother was crippled by
that bastard Qu Hanshan,

09:28.750 --> 09:30.030
and his martial arts were ruined.

09:30.030 --> 09:31.630
He's resting in his room now.

10:00.000 --> 10:00.930
You've escaped.

10:02.030 --> 10:02.630
Good.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.710
How did you get injured so badly?

10:18.240 --> 10:20.040
Qu Hanshan actually dared to...

10:24.790 --> 10:25.590
It's nothing.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.440
I just carelessly

10:28.240 --> 10:30.900
fell into
that old scoundrel Qu Hanshan's trap.

10:39.630 --> 10:40.270
I'm sorry.

10:41.030 --> 10:42.960
I couldn't do anything to help you.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.910
This is the first time
I've heard you

10:45.910 --> 10:47.110
say sorry, Miss Tang.

10:56.000 --> 10:57.200
It wasn't your fault.

11:00.270 --> 11:01.030
How about

11:01.550 --> 11:03.790
lending me your lucky darts?

11:07.480 --> 11:08.740
What, still so stingy?

11:09.270 --> 11:10.800
Look how badly injured I am.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.720
Lend me one of your darts

11:13.360 --> 11:14.690
so I can protect myself.

11:33.190 --> 11:34.510
You're really giving it to me?

11:34.510 --> 11:35.510
I'll take it then.

11:39.030 --> 11:39.550
Thanks.

11:42.150 --> 11:44.480
Is there anything else
I can help you with?

11:50.960 --> 11:52.290
I heard from Zuoqiu that

11:52.800 --> 11:54.330
there's a reclusive master

11:55.480 --> 11:58.080
who created a uniquely powerful
Healing Salve

11:58.870 --> 12:00.790
capable of mending bones
and reconnecting tendons,

12:00.790 --> 12:03.080
which might cure my injuries.

12:05.360 --> 12:06.560
Where is that master?

12:10.290 --> 12:10.910
Brothers,

12:11.940 --> 12:13.670
there's something you must do.

12:13.790 --> 12:15.360
This Qu Hanshan is a sly fox.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.320
You need to take Tang Fang

12:17.320 --> 12:19.250
to a place 15 miles outside the city

12:19.390 --> 12:20.190
and tie her up.

12:22.360 --> 12:24.510
Big Brother, I don't think
that's appropriate.

12:24.510 --> 12:25.240
Why not?

12:25.750 --> 12:27.680
Remember what Tang Rou asked of us?

12:27.790 --> 12:29.390
We must keep his sister safe.

12:30.790 --> 12:31.320
Go now.

12:33.000 --> 12:33.550
Yes.

12:35.000 --> 12:37.600
That master lives in seclusion
15 miles south of the villa.

12:37.600 --> 12:38.510
I originally wanted to go myself,

12:38.510 --> 12:42.310
but I feared I wouldn't be able to
talk my way into getting that salve.

12:45.270 --> 12:47.330
There's no time to waste. I'll go now.

12:48.390 --> 12:50.790
Don't let anything happen before I return.

12:51.120 --> 12:51.780
Wait for me.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.470
Miss Tang.

13:01.150 --> 13:03.010
Big Brother, how are you feeling?

13:05.400 --> 13:07.230
Miss Tang did come back

13:07.390 --> 13:08.320
as you expected.

13:09.030 --> 13:11.560
It's just that
you're seriously injured now,

13:12.030 --> 13:14.030
so stop worrying about everything.

13:17.790 --> 13:20.050
She's already isolated in the Tang Sect.

13:20.790 --> 13:21.390
Besides,

13:22.960 --> 13:25.090
I can't let her be implicated anymore.

13:25.550 --> 13:26.150
Moreover,

13:26.910 --> 13:29.970
I promised Tang Rou
that I would take care of his sister.

13:32.630 --> 13:33.720
If I fail to do that,

13:36.600 --> 13:38.000
how could I ever face him

13:40.550 --> 13:41.750
in the netherworld?

13:43.600 --> 13:46.030
Big Brother, what nonsense
are you talking about?

13:46.030 --> 13:47.630
Didn't you say it would be foolproof

13:47.630 --> 13:49.120
and you'd come out unscathed?

13:49.120 --> 13:50.180
Don't you lie to me.

13:53.150 --> 13:53.880
Don't worry.

13:54.870 --> 13:57.130
You don't even believe my words anymore?

13:59.440 --> 14:00.900
Here, take your medicine.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.270
I'm sorry, Miss Tang.

14:43.270 --> 14:44.150
It's you.

14:45.030 --> 14:45.630
Why?

14:46.000 --> 14:47.550
Miss Tang, please stay calm.

14:47.550 --> 14:49.120
They'll stay here with you until dark.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.320
Once the mechanism is deactivated,

14:50.320 --> 14:51.780
remember: do not return to Huanhua Villa,

14:51.780 --> 14:53.200
and absolutely don't go to
Top Fairness Forest.

14:53.200 --> 14:55.870
Big Brother wants you to return to
the Tang Sect immediately.

14:55.870 --> 14:57.120
Xiao Qiushui?

14:57.670 --> 15:00.130
What kind of scheme is he plotting
this time?

15:00.790 --> 15:02.840
Miss Tang, until we meet again.

15:05.840 --> 15:06.390
Don't go!

15:06.840 --> 15:07.670
Keep a close watch on Miss Tang.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.150
Yes.

15:08.510 --> 15:09.550
Release me now!

15:14.000 --> 15:15.910
I never thought that in this world,

15:15.910 --> 15:17.840
being a hero would be so difficult.

15:18.960 --> 15:20.960
But there's no chance left anymore.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.940
My parents and friends...

15:23.790 --> 15:25.390
Their fates have long since

15:25.390 --> 15:28.590
become more than just
a few insignificant lines in a book.

15:28.720 --> 15:30.650
My parents gave me the hope of life.

15:31.600 --> 15:32.550
Even if I die,

15:33.870 --> 15:36.120
I will expose Qu Hanshan's true colors.

15:37.360 --> 15:39.560
Even if I can't return to the real world,

15:39.910 --> 15:40.670
I accept it.

15:53.110 --> 15:54.390
I wonder whether leaving Qiushui alone

15:54.390 --> 15:55.440
in the villa

15:56.240 --> 15:57.910
will turn out for better or worse.

15:57.910 --> 16:01.040
Taking Qiushui along
would make the journey difficult.

16:01.200 --> 16:03.660
Better to let him stay
and recover properly.

16:04.870 --> 16:06.510
Qiushui is seriously injured.

16:06.510 --> 16:09.310
Sparing him the hardship of travel
is for the best.

16:17.200 --> 16:17.840
Mr. Qu.

16:18.600 --> 16:20.330
I, on behalf of the Xiao family,

16:20.360 --> 16:21.690
thank you for your help.

16:22.550 --> 16:25.240
I, Qu Hanshan, have spent my life
fighting for justice.

16:25.240 --> 16:27.080
I've long despised the Power Gang.

16:27.080 --> 16:29.670
How could I stand by
and watch the Xiao family suffer?

16:29.670 --> 16:31.750
Aside from the Five Tigers of Guangling
waiting in the Top Fairness Forest,

16:31.750 --> 16:33.510
the righteous warriors from other sects
have all set out

16:33.510 --> 16:35.320
to meet at the tea pavilion
in the outskirts.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.390
My sister Xueyu

16:36.630 --> 16:38.320
is already waiting at the tea pavilion.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.510
The situation is critical now.

16:39.510 --> 16:41.360
Mr. Xiao, we must set out immediately.

16:41.360 --> 16:41.950
Please.

16:42.650 --> 16:43.250
After you.

16:50.650 --> 17:01.340
[Top Fairness Forest]

17:11.240 --> 17:13.030
Yiren, it's Qiushui.

17:13.240 --> 17:13.770
Qiushui.

17:19.000 --> 17:19.790
Qiushui?

17:19.790 --> 17:20.400
This...

17:24.200 --> 17:24.720
Mr. Qu.

17:25.310 --> 17:28.030
It seems my brother Qiushui
has been waiting here for you,

17:28.030 --> 17:29.430
specially to see you off.

17:33.550 --> 17:34.080
Let's go.

17:42.640 --> 17:44.500
Qiushui, what are you doing here?

17:46.140 --> 17:47.570
Aren't you badly injured?

17:47.570 --> 17:48.900
What are you doing here?

17:52.110 --> 17:52.960
Qu Hanshan

17:54.960 --> 17:58.110
has set aside past grudges
and tolerated our Xiao family.

17:58.110 --> 18:01.550
I've come specially
to apologize to him.

18:07.400 --> 18:08.350
Mr. Qu.

18:10.830 --> 18:14.750
I was indeed in the wrong before.

18:16.240 --> 18:17.370
My apologies.

18:27.440 --> 18:29.590
Mr. Qu, it seems Qiushui

18:30.160 --> 18:31.960
truly remembers your kindness.

18:32.270 --> 18:33.920
Now that he realizes his mistake,

18:33.920 --> 18:36.000
he's come specially to apologize to you.

18:36.000 --> 18:36.680
So...

18:41.300 --> 18:42.630
Mr. Xiao, your gesture

18:43.310 --> 18:44.510
is quite unexpected.

18:53.350 --> 18:54.350
Are you all right?

19:02.960 --> 19:03.880
Mr. Qu.

19:04.750 --> 19:07.440
I truly came to
sincerely apologize to you.

19:09.070 --> 19:09.790
I was indeed

19:10.550 --> 19:11.960
in the wrong before.

19:13.720 --> 19:14.400
However,

19:16.160 --> 19:17.310
there's something

19:18.920 --> 19:21.120
I'd like to discuss with you in private.

19:30.350 --> 19:32.280
It's about the Hero Command Token.

19:36.350 --> 19:38.590
Yiren, Qiushui won't

19:38.640 --> 19:40.300
talk nonsense again, will he?

19:46.110 --> 19:46.680
Yiren.

19:47.790 --> 19:48.510
Kaiyan.

20:17.830 --> 20:18.720
Mr. Qu.

20:20.750 --> 20:24.670
I know I offended you before.

20:27.430 --> 20:29.290
Actually, the Hero Command Token

20:31.590 --> 20:33.480
isn't as simple as you think.

20:39.590 --> 20:41.520
What exactly are you trying to say?

20:47.920 --> 20:49.070
Disgusting.

20:51.590 --> 20:53.350
What exactly are you trying to say?

20:53.350 --> 20:54.550
Just say it properly.

21:16.310 --> 21:18.240
You're already in this condition.

21:22.200 --> 21:24.110
Still trying to play tricks?

21:47.170 --> 21:50.280
I-I don't want to play any tricks.

22:02.240 --> 22:04.110
What I want to tell you is...

22:13.640 --> 22:16.960
I'm going to tear off your mask!

22:28.880 --> 22:29.840
You set me up!

22:50.820 --> 22:51.830
The Sword King? This...

22:51.830 --> 22:52.680
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

22:52.680 --> 22:53.590
He truly is the Sword King.

22:53.590 --> 22:55.390
He never let anyone discover it.

22:55.550 --> 22:57.680
-It's the Sword King.
-The Sword King?

22:57.680 --> 22:58.270
Yiren.

22:58.400 --> 22:59.930
It's Blood Qi Sword Energy.

23:07.550 --> 23:08.080
Retreat!

23:09.790 --> 23:10.990
-Qiushui.
-Qiushui.

23:11.550 --> 23:12.480
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

23:12.480 --> 23:13.070
Qiushui!

23:13.440 --> 23:14.870
-Qiushui!
-Third Young Master!

23:14.870 --> 23:15.920
-Big Brother!
-Qiushui!

23:15.920 --> 23:17.720
-Qiushui!
-Third Young Master!

23:18.510 --> 23:19.070
Qiushui!

23:20.960 --> 23:22.620
Qiushui, how are you feeling?

23:24.020 --> 23:24.820
Big Brother!

23:26.590 --> 23:28.310
-Qiushui!
-Qiushui.

23:35.920 --> 23:36.680
Qiushui.

23:40.960 --> 23:43.090
You've been prepared to die all along.

23:47.720 --> 23:48.480
Kaiyan.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.160
Yiren.

23:55.070 --> 23:56.200
I've caused

24:00.440 --> 24:02.070
you trouble again.

24:06.160 --> 24:06.960
Yiren.

24:09.640 --> 24:10.510
I have

24:12.590 --> 24:14.920
never lied to you.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.240
Yiren, Kaiyan.

24:38.790 --> 24:39.830
No matter what...

24:40.680 --> 24:41.310
Qiushui.

24:43.110 --> 24:45.110
You must save Father and Mother.

24:47.270 --> 24:48.240
I promise you

24:48.750 --> 24:49.880
to save our parents.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.770
We'll save them. Don't worry.

24:53.110 --> 24:56.200
Rest assured.

25:06.550 --> 25:07.640
My dear brothers.

25:08.400 --> 25:11.060
-Big Brother, I'm here.
-I'm here, Big Brother.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.160
Qiushui.

25:27.900 --> 25:28.630
Big Brother.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.310
Qiushui.

25:32.590 --> 25:34.000
-Qiushui!
-Qiushui.

25:36.440 --> 25:37.510
Qiushui.

25:38.400 --> 25:39.110
Qiushui.

25:39.110 --> 25:41.400
I've made noodles for you. Come eat.

25:41.750 --> 25:43.240
What are you waiting for, Qiushui?

25:43.240 --> 25:44.550
The noodles are getting cold.

25:44.550 --> 25:46.590
Qiushui, Mother made
your favorite noodles.

25:46.590 --> 25:47.270
Come on.

25:47.510 --> 25:50.070
Qiushui, if you don't eat
these delicious noodles,

25:50.070 --> 25:50.880
I'll eat them.

25:52.880 --> 25:54.960
Qiushui. Qiushui,

25:55.180 --> 25:56.510
it's time for practice.

26:07.590 --> 26:08.320
Big Brother!

26:11.560 --> 26:12.720
Big Brother, excellent sword skills.

26:12.720 --> 26:14.560
Big Brother, your sword skills
are getting better and better.

26:14.560 --> 26:16.440
Big Brother, take good care of Fang.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.760
Who needs your care?

26:19.270 --> 26:20.790
Qiushui, come eat the noodles.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.480
-Qiushui.
-Big Brother.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.030
Come eat. The noodles are getting cold.

26:23.030 --> 26:24.310
-Qiushui?
-Come on, Qiushui.

26:24.310 --> 26:25.240
What are you waiting for, Qiushui?

26:25.240 --> 26:26.550
We're all waiting for you. Come on.

26:26.550 --> 26:28.200
Qiushui, hurry up.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.030
Qiushui, everyone's waiting for you.

26:29.030 --> 26:30.110
Qiushui, come on.

26:30.400 --> 26:31.310
Don't go, Qiushui!

26:31.310 --> 26:32.680
-Qiushui!
-Where is Big Brother going?

26:32.680 --> 26:36.200
-Qiushui!
-Qiushui!

26:36.590 --> 26:37.790
-Qiushui!
-Qiushui!

26:37.960 --> 26:38.790
Qiushui!

26:39.720 --> 26:40.550
Qiushui.

26:42.440 --> 26:43.480
-Big Brother!
-Qiushui!

26:43.480 --> 26:45.200
-Third Young Master!
-Qiushui!

26:45.200 --> 26:46.510
-Third Young Master!
-Qiushui!

26:46.510 --> 26:47.310
Qiushui!

26:48.310 --> 26:49.590
Qiushui!

26:50.550 --> 26:51.790
Big Brother...

26:53.640 --> 26:54.350
Qiushui...

26:55.030 --> 26:55.880
Qiushui!

26:55.200 --> 26:57.510
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

26:57.530 --> 27:02.240
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

27:02.500 --> 27:04.850
♪ The wind blows ♪

27:04.880 --> 27:09.320
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

27:09.920 --> 27:12.370
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

27:12.390 --> 27:14.860
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

27:14.880 --> 27:17.990
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

27:18.680 --> 27:25.960
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

27:25.480 --> 27:26.200
Yiren.

27:28.160 --> 27:31.590
I never thought Qiushui would go so far
as to risk his life to make his point.

27:29.980 --> 27:33.080
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

27:33.000 --> 27:36.790
Qiushui said Sword Manor
wouldn't hold out much longer.

27:33.210 --> 27:36.430
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

27:37.390 --> 27:40.660
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

27:38.030 --> 27:38.960
This time,

27:40.730 --> 27:43.720
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

27:41.250 --> 27:43.580
let's follow Qiushui's advice, shall we?

27:44.890 --> 27:48.090
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

27:48.110 --> 27:51.750
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

27:51.830 --> 27:52.550
Yiren.

27:52.290 --> 27:55.180
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

27:54.350 --> 27:56.310
We've uncovered
the Sword King's true identity.

27:56.000 --> 27:58.250
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

27:57.960 --> 27:59.720
I'm afraid he might take other actions.

27:58.750 --> 28:00.740
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

28:00.760 --> 28:04.820
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

28:00.830 --> 28:02.160
Before he strikes back,

28:02.720 --> 28:05.110
we should hurry on our way.

28:06.480 --> 28:09.150
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

28:09.180 --> 28:12.640
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

28:10.680 --> 28:11.920
But Qiushui...

28:12.750 --> 28:13.550
Yiren.

28:13.230 --> 28:15.790
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

28:14.110 --> 28:15.510
You stay here for now.

28:15.810 --> 28:20.060
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

28:16.230 --> 28:18.030
I'll lead a troop to Sword Manor.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.160
If we split up,

28:20.110 --> 28:22.240
we can divert the Sword King's attention.

28:20.530 --> 28:22.980
♪ The wind blows ♪

28:22.720 --> 28:24.160
We must defend Sword Manor well.

28:23.000 --> 28:27.930
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

28:25.750 --> 28:27.610
Only by safeguarding Sword Manor

28:28.040 --> 28:30.280
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

28:29.310 --> 28:31.590
can Big Brother rest in peace.

28:30.450 --> 28:33.070
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

28:33.070 --> 28:35.030
I'll fight to the death
to save the Xiao family

28:33.090 --> 28:36.310
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

28:35.880 --> 28:37.160
and fulfill Big Brother's dying wish!

28:36.850 --> 28:43.190
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

28:38.790 --> 28:39.440
Right.

28:40.480 --> 28:42.160
Qiushui did all this

28:43.510 --> 28:44.640
so that we could

28:44.310 --> 28:51.990
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

28:45.590 --> 28:47.190
safely return to Sword Manor

28:47.720 --> 28:48.920
and save our parents.

28:52.790 --> 28:53.480
Mr. Liang.

28:54.160 --> 28:57.480
Take some men and arrange
Third Young Master's burial immediately.

28:57.480 --> 28:59.480
Please rest assured, Young Master.

29:00.030 --> 29:00.710
Kaiyan.

29:01.480 --> 29:02.720
Let's split up then.

29:02.930 --> 29:04.190
You take the waterway,

29:04.270 --> 29:07.160
and the rest will follow me
back to Jinzhong immediately.

29:07.160 --> 29:07.960
Yes!

30:12.440 --> 30:14.570
[In Memory of My Late Younger Brother,
Xiao Qiushui]

30:50.350 --> 30:51.110
Miss Tang.

30:57.200 --> 30:59.120
What exactly happened?

31:11.830 --> 31:14.690
Before his death,
Third Young Master instructed me

31:14.920 --> 31:15.680
that if

31:16.230 --> 31:18.140
you ever came back looking for him,
Miss Tang,

31:18.140 --> 31:20.200
I should give you these relics of his.

31:57.590 --> 31:58.240
Tang Fang.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.680
I'm sorry

32:10.680 --> 32:12.070
for sending you away.

32:18.400 --> 32:19.270
Old Madam Wu

32:20.200 --> 32:22.400
asked me to find Crazy Yan's relatives.

32:24.000 --> 32:24.930
Unfortunately,

32:28.240 --> 32:29.640
I won't be able to fulfill this task.

32:28.750 --> 32:31.160
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

32:31.510 --> 32:32.750
If you ever see Old Madam Wu,

32:32.020 --> 32:34.800
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

32:34.590 --> 32:37.830
please return this Golden Swallow
to her for me.

32:36.410 --> 32:39.580
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

32:39.920 --> 32:44.320
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

32:43.650 --> 32:45.170
And that dagger Mr. Zhang Linyi

32:45.170 --> 32:48.570
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

32:46.830 --> 32:48.240
gave me.

32:48.960 --> 32:52.320
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

32:51.270 --> 32:52.600
Please tell Senior that

32:53.260 --> 32:56.080
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

32:54.830 --> 32:55.880
I, Xiao Qiushui,

32:56.100 --> 33:00.800
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

32:58.480 --> 32:59.810
have never let him down.

33:00.850 --> 33:02.850
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

33:02.870 --> 33:04.870
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

33:05.090 --> 33:07.830
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

33:08.410 --> 33:10.640
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

33:09.160 --> 33:09.830
Alright.

33:10.660 --> 33:16.010
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

33:11.720 --> 33:12.790
I've said too much.

33:15.310 --> 33:16.860
The most important thing now is

33:16.860 --> 33:18.920
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

33:18.940 --> 33:20.940
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

33:19.350 --> 33:20.830
that you all live well.

33:21.080 --> 33:24.220
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

33:23.110 --> 33:24.680
Don't ever try to avenge me.

33:24.470 --> 33:26.770
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

33:26.870 --> 33:30.970
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

34:06.970 --> 34:08.159
You liar.

34:08.889 --> 34:10.880
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

34:10.960 --> 34:13.560
I won't shed a single tear for you.

34:11.900 --> 34:14.889
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

34:16.389 --> 34:19.889
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

34:20.090 --> 34:24.719
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

34:25.070 --> 34:27.400
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

34:28.880 --> 34:32.060
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

34:32.469 --> 34:34.280
That's quite a rash vow you made.

34:32.940 --> 34:35.960
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

34:34.630 --> 34:36.190
If I hadn't given you a hand just now,

34:35.980 --> 34:41.050
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

34:36.190 --> 34:38.050
you'd have fallen into the river.

34:38.590 --> 34:39.510
My mother said,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.150
unless this person is my husband,

34:41.080 --> 34:42.830
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

34:41.360 --> 34:42.860
no exception should be made.

34:42.860 --> 34:44.860
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

34:45.100 --> 34:47.900
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

34:48.570 --> 34:50.810
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

34:50.840 --> 34:55.949
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

34:56.190 --> 34:57.480
Once our Xiao family is out of this siege,

34:56.889 --> 34:58.900
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

34:58.030 --> 34:59.190
if I do find

34:58.930 --> 35:00.930
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

35:00.110 --> 35:01.630
the "Voidheart Codex" one day,

35:00.950 --> 35:03.810
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

35:02.360 --> 35:04.590
I'll definitely tell you about
its whereabouts.

35:04.590 --> 35:06.750
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

35:06.860 --> 35:12.240
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

35:12.970 --> 35:14.840
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

35:14.870 --> 35:16.870
♪ A few wild howls ♪

35:17.040 --> 35:20.100
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

35:20.510 --> 35:22.600
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

35:22.630 --> 35:27.730
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

35:28.920 --> 35:30.830
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

35:30.860 --> 35:32.990
♪ Several rounds of turmoil ♪

35:33.010 --> 35:35.980
♪ Swaying in life-and-death dreams ♪

35:36.620 --> 35:38.620
♪ Shadows under countless lamps
over a thousand lifetimes ♪

35:38.650 --> 35:43.480
♪ Each leaves a single light
to shine through this night ♪

35:45.010 --> 35:47.010
♪ Smoke drifts, the road stretches far ♪

35:47.030 --> 35:49.000
♪ Love fades, people grow distant ♪

35:49.050 --> 35:51.050
♪ Flowers fall as dawn approaches ♪

35:51.080 --> 35:56.290
♪ Heart like fine rain,
drifting with the clouds ♪

36:02.400 --> 36:05.480
Mr. Liang, you said
that bastard Qu is still alive, right?

36:05.480 --> 36:06.740
Where is he hiding now?

36:06.760 --> 36:08.670
Miss Tang, are you planning to...

36:09.760 --> 36:10.750
You absolutely must not.

36:10.750 --> 36:11.960
Young Master instructed

36:11.960 --> 36:13.690
that you must not seek revenge.

36:13.710 --> 36:15.190
If anything happens to you,

36:15.190 --> 36:16.480
Young Master, whose body is barely cold,

36:16.480 --> 36:17.880
would not rest in peace.

36:18.400 --> 36:20.530
I don't care if he rests in peace or not.

36:20.880 --> 36:23.880
I know you're eager to avenge
Young Master, Miss Tang,

36:23.880 --> 36:26.920
but he forbade you from seeking revenge
for your own good.

36:26.920 --> 36:29.710
Please understand his intentions
just this once.

36:29.710 --> 36:31.170
Did he ever understand me?

36:31.320 --> 36:31.760
I...

36:59.720 --> 37:03.790
♪ This mortal world is written
with grudges and favors ♪

37:03.810 --> 37:07.480
♪ Stories intertwine endlessly ♪

37:08.500 --> 37:13.180
♪ A young boy bearing a sword,
with wishes and thoughts ♪

37:13.210 --> 37:17.130
♪ Rushes through the ever-changing
seas and lands ♪

37:17.830 --> 37:22.370
♪ Facing the perils of life,
watching time's passage ♪

37:22.400 --> 37:26.270
♪ Exploring the depths of
the martial world ♪

37:24.320 --> 37:25.850
This is the symbol of Libra.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.670
Here, take it—

37:27.460 --> 37:31.690
♪ The wounds we bear
and the memories we paint ♪

37:27.920 --> 37:30.380
think of it as Tang Rou
always being with you.

37:32.040 --> 37:36.430
♪ Weave together into a red thread ♪

37:35.370 --> 37:37.100
He should be in that direction.

37:37.790 --> 37:40.660
♪ Before the moonlight fades away ♪

37:40.700 --> 37:43.180
♪ I want to ask once more ♪

37:43.220 --> 37:47.700
♪ Which star are you that lights my way ♪

37:48.160 --> 37:52.130
♪ Raising wine and wielding a sword,
venturing between mountains and seas ♪

37:52.150 --> 37:56.210
♪ Don't forget the attachments
in your heart ♪

37:54.960 --> 37:56.280
Xiao Qiushui.

37:56.310 --> 37:59.470
♪ The mortal world,
fleeting as smoke and clouds ♪

37:58.320 --> 38:00.480
Which star in the sky are you now?

37:59.500 --> 38:01.680
♪ Banished to the horizon ♪

38:01.700 --> 38:06.050
♪ I will accompany you to forget time ♪

38:06.460 --> 38:10.730
♪ With countless memories, we gradually ♪

38:10.850 --> 38:15.400
♪ Come to understand the meaning of fate ♪

38:24.590 --> 38:26.320
Mr. Liang! Mr. Liang!

38:28.360 --> 38:29.220
What happened?

38:31.480 --> 38:33.080
Third Young Master...

38:40.660 --> 38:43.420
[Restart]

40:14.070 --> 40:14.760
Feng Lang.

40:23.010 --> 40:23.740
No.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.760
You're not Feng Lang.

40:29.230 --> 40:30.090
I was wondering

40:31.230 --> 40:34.280
how long you'd keep mistaking me
for that Feng Lang.

40:43.960 --> 40:45.470
Liu Suifeng.

40:47.630 --> 40:49.510
We first met at Qunfang House.

40:50.670 --> 40:53.130
If it weren't for your friend
surnamed Feng,

40:53.190 --> 40:55.030
I wouldn't have escaped so easily

40:55.030 --> 40:57.160
from Sword King Qu Hanshan's pursuit,

40:57.510 --> 40:59.070
and I wouldn't have tracked down

40:59.070 --> 41:01.280
the Hero Command Token so easily.

41:01.630 --> 41:02.280
But

41:04.710 --> 41:06.240
I didn't wrong him, either—

41:06.480 --> 41:08.170
right to the center of the forehead,

41:08.170 --> 41:09.770
the most painless way to die.

41:11.590 --> 41:12.920
You're disgusting.

41:33.180 --> 41:35.030
You'd better not
make any rash moves.

41:35.030 --> 41:37.880
You were injured by Sword King
Qu Hanshan's Blood Qi Sword Energy.

41:37.880 --> 41:39.280
If I hadn't given you

41:39.280 --> 41:41.510
the Herbal King's
Life-Extending Pill in time,

41:41.510 --> 41:43.480
your heart meridians
would have been severed

41:43.480 --> 41:45.080
beyond any hope of recovery.

42:05.840 --> 42:08.840
Even now, you're still pretending
to be a good person.

42:10.710 --> 42:12.320
You're truly despicable.

42:19.190 --> 42:21.450
Where exactly is the Hero Command Token?

42:22.020 --> 42:23.460
You exploited my trust,

42:23.480 --> 42:25.140
infiltrated the Xiao family,

42:27.440 --> 42:29.280
and put Sword Manor in danger.

42:30.670 --> 42:32.930
Now I've come to Guangling seeking help,

42:33.190 --> 42:34.760
only to be framed and set up.

42:36.550 --> 42:38.480
That was your doing too, wasn't it?

42:38.590 --> 42:39.190
Correct.

42:39.670 --> 42:40.880
All of your actions

42:41.710 --> 42:43.640
have been within my calculations.

42:43.710 --> 42:45.640
The only thing I didn't account for

42:46.190 --> 42:48.920
was that you would play the hero
to such a reckless extent,

42:48.920 --> 42:50.400
even willing to cripple
your own martial skills

42:50.400 --> 42:52.230
for that impossible hope.

42:57.150 --> 42:59.320
You're indeed a master of calculations.

42:59.320 --> 43:00.920
But have you ever calculated

43:02.380 --> 43:03.700
when your own end will come?
